  "label": "User projected onto the recruitment scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene where Darth Vader is recruiting Snoop Dogg to the dark side, with the text 'come to the dark side, we have weed.' The humor and intent of the meme invite the user to imagine themselves in Snoop Dogg's position, being offered a choice by the dark side. The user is implicitly positioned as the potential recruit, making the scene a direct projection of the user's perspective.",
